WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.601
Welcome back to

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.436
Ukraine, marking the anniversary

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.071
of the liberation of bootcamp,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.473
the town near key

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.374
that the Ukrainian

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.141
president calls

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.177
a symbol of Russian atrocities.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.078
Vladimir Zelenskiy

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.280
says Ukraine will never forgive

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.782
those responsible.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.216
Moscow's

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:20.053
forces occupied that town for 33 days

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.889
And mass graves were found after

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.958
it was recaptured

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.127
when the occupying troops left bodies

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.262
in the streets as they escaped.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.265
They are accused of executions, of rape

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.200
and of torture.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.336
Russia denies those accusations.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.639
Ukraine's resilience is on full display

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:40.707
in a frontline

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.542
town in the eastern part of the

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.343
country today.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.077
Drinking water

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.546
that has become hard to get.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.581
But as Ben Wedeman reports, residents

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:49.549
carrying on

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.751
with some help from the outside

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.890
Without water, there is no life.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:58.391
And the clean water

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.593
pouring into these plastic jugs

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.529
is a vital lifeline for people

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.364
in the battered eastern Ukrainian

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.032
town of Siversk

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.701
just six miles from Russian lines.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:12.572
Retired building contractor Andrei

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.340
Anderson from Oregon

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.876
is an unlikely carrier of water.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.244
It was just a calling

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.080
that I couldn't refuse to do.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.482
I can't sit at home and allow

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.451
allow this to happen

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.853
without helping the people who need help.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.588
He's part of a volunteer group

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.256
called Aqueducts.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.659
They're routine, simple but essential.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:33.626
We turn up,

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.228
they turn up with our little jugs

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:37.063
and we fill up their jugs

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.365
or that buckets or their cow pails,

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.101
and they get away happy.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.735
And we have our tank.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.070
We drive home,

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.638
and then we come back in the afternoon

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:46.473
and we do the same thing

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.775
and we repeat on every day.

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.077
The few remaining in severe

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.846
tell the usual story

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.914
dogged attachment to their land

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.416
and no other options.

00:01:57.817 --> 00:01:58.651
How can I leave?

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.786
Ask Tanya.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.521
My son is buried here

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.455
and where would I go

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.958
with my small pension?

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.092
Andre's colleague,

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:08.161
Silvia Pervis from Austria,

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.696
was a tour guide.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.865
Why are you doing this?

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:12.899
To help.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.468
Just the right thing to do.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.236
73 year

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:18.404
old Nikola appreciates the water,

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.340
but thirsts for quiet.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.042
No dialog I'm fed up with his shelling.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.912
Nobody needs it, he says.

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:27.280
What passes for daily

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.349
life ended long ago.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:31.718
The center of survivors is a wasteland.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.153
The early spring

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.387
snow softens

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.689
but can't hide the jagged edges.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.558
Voter

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.659
Andre shouts out

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.761
Water, vodka, in Ukrainian.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.096
Soon, residents

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.831
emerge from their basements,

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.399
their bomb shelters.

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:48.535
Basic humanitarian services

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:50.570
like this are critical.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.772
There hasn't been any running water

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.474
or electricity

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:56.910
since the beginning of the war.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.078
With no end to this war in sight,

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.614
they're resigned to a fate bleak.

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:05.018
Don't worry, it's fine, says Valentina.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.753
We put up with everything.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.922
What can we do? It's totally true.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:11.991
Yet 70 year old Nina despairs at

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:14.394
what has become of her town hall.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:15.828
What do we feel?

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:16.763
She asks.

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.631
Pain. Pain.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.300
When you see something destroyed,

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.367
you tear up.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.303
We cry. We cry.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.337
And we like you.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.440
Bottles now fall.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.309
They return through streets,

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:30.276
cold, muddy

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.345
and ravaged to their shelters.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:36.182
Ben Wedeman, CNN, severe Eastern Ukraine.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.320
Turkey has approved Finland's

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.454
bid to join NATO.

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:42.689
After months of delays,

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.057
the Turkish parliament

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.491
voted unanimously

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:46.526
in favor of Finland's

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:47.894
membership on Thursday.

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:48.461
Clearing

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:51.030
what is the last hurdle for Helsinki.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:52.765
Well, the vote fulfills a promise

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:53.333
from Turkey's

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:54.200
president

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.835
to not oppose Finland's

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:57.437
entry into the alliance.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.939
Now, Turkey was the last of NATO's

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.107
30 members

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.243
to ratify Finland's membership.

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:04.777
Sweden, of course,

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.945
has also applied to join.

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:07.347
But Turkey and Hungary

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:09.315
remain opposed by Sweden.

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:10.083
And Finland

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:11.884
ended decades of neutrality

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:14.220
after Russia's invasion of Ukraine.

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:15.188
Well, Finland's

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:17.190
president thanked every NATO member

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.291
for their trust and support

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:19.259
and promised Finland

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.394
will be a strong and capable

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.363
ally committed to the security

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:24.797
of the alliance.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.799
NATO's secretary general welcoming

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:27.467
the development

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:28.334
and tweeting, quote,

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.570
This will make the whole NATO's family

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:32.272
stronger and safer.

